 "description": "<p>Black-and-white maid styling is the backbone of Japanese cosplay, and this set keeps the formula classic: a soft chiffon dress, a neck ring, and a matching thong, all in the colorway shown. The fabric drapes with very little weight, so the skirt moves when you do instead of sitting stiff.</p>\n<p>The Lolita-leaning silhouette works for convention floors, photoshoots, and private role-play alike. Layer it with white knee socks and a curled wig for a full character look, or strip the styling back to the dress alone for something quieter.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: chiffon</li>\n<li>Includes: dress, neck ring, thong</li>\n<li>Style: Japanese maid, black and white</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: M (40-50 kg), L (50-60 kg), XL (60-70 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Check your weight against the chart before ordering - the bodice is cut fitted, and going one size up gives a looser skirt.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>High-stretch chiffon Lolita maid set in black and white, with dress, neck ring and thong in M to XL.</p>\n",
